OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's first 'fire dog' is
OL,4,Ahonoured with statue in Glasgow Central
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor several years he was a familiar
OL,7,Fsight on the streets of Glasgow, racing
OL,8,Ftowards blazes just ahead of the city's
OL,9,Ffiremen.
OL,11,FNow Scotland's first ever "fire dog" -
OL,12,Fa setter-collie called Wallace - has
OL,13,Fbeen honoured in the city with a
OL,14,Fstatue, 104 years after he died.
OL,16,FWallace was taken in by firemen at the
OL,17,FCentral Fire Station in 1894 after he
OL,18,Ffollowed a horse-drawn engine taking
OL,19,Fpart in a lifeboat demonstration, and
OL,20,Fbecame well-known around the city.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
