OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's first 'fire dog' is
OL,4,Ahonoured with statue in Glasgow Central
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new statue is at Glasgow Central
OL,7,Frailway station, following several
OL,8,Fyears of campaigning by Possilpark
OL,9,Fwoman Jean Dallas.
